## **Agentic AI in API Onboarding – Value Proposition**

### **Current State (Today)**

* Fully automated CI/CD pipelines for API onboarding
* Rule-based validation and deployment to Apigee
* Reactive process → failures require manual fixes

---

### **With Agentic AI (Enhanced Model)**

* Conversational onboarding (intent → API definition)
* Intelligent pre-validation (reduce pipeline failures)
* Automated suggestions (OAS, policies, standards)
* Real-time feedback and self-healing capabilities

---

### **Key Value Add**

* Reduced rework and faster onboarding
* Improved developer experience (less dependency on platform knowledge)
* Stronger standardisation and governance
* Smarter pipelines (proactive vs reactive)

---

### **Positioning**

👉 *Agentic AI does not replace CI/CD—it adds an intelligent layer to make onboarding smarter, faster, and more user-friendly.*

